profile: tinyrustlm-mirust.test-plan.current.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-28T20:20:00Z

required_gate:
  - Exact two-use MemoryEndpoints.com policy is present and noncontradictory in all maintained authority surfaces.
  - No active public or UAI source treats .slm, old package names, compatibility, fallback, or historical runtime material as current authority.
  - Archive and public package manifests regenerate deterministically and match their declared files.
  - PHP syntax passes for every PHP file when PHP 8 is available.
  - JSON and XML parse; current links and route-smoke markers resolve.
  - Real Chromium desktop and mobile smokes have no overflow, failed assets, console errors, or incoherent overlap.
  - Git diff, secret, public-boundary, package, and release checks pass.
  - Final source is committed, pushed, remote-exact, deployed from its manifest, and verified byte-for-byte over HTTPS.

claim_rule: Record unavailable tools or external blockers honestly; never convert a partial gate into publication evidence.
